flowchart TD
    User --> Request[Validated intent]
    Request --> Model[Selected model or agent base]
    Model --> Files[Generated files]
    Files --> Policy[Command policy]
    Policy --> Timeout[Execution timeout]
    Timeout --> Checks[Acceptance checks]
    Checks --> Human[Maintainer sign-off]
    Human --> Attestation[Signed attestation]
    Attestation --> Reproduce[Hash and signature recheck]
